Sanity is overrated and after years of hacking at NetHacks source code
I'd say, it's also an obstacle for successfully programming NetHack. ;-D


In this case the rest of the goto_level method is actually worse.

A simple "if (!Is_stronghold(&u.uz) { flip_level_rnd(3); }" in
sp_lev.c would already do as a workaround.(*)

