Patric

(*) For a simple transformation it's amazing how alien those levels
look. Although for mine town I see this as a disadvantage. When
entering mine town I always get the - completely subjective and
unsubstantiated - feeling of reaching a safe haven. With flipped
levels mine town completely lacks familiarity.

